  "question": {
    "text": "If the line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> bisects two chords of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></math> which are passing through the point&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the length of the latus rectum can be equal to",
